To improve response times, we can explore optimization techniques such as caching, quantization, and fine-tuning of AI models. We will also ensure that our solution is designed with security in mind, using encryption (AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit) and secrets management tools like HashiCorp Vault.

